#ASSERT `what the Company pays under` `the CGL part` `, for` `the policy` `,` `the ordinary CGL claim` `,` `the ordinary sums` `,` `the hypothetical rates` `,` `nothing paid yet` EQUALS 1_089_100_000
#ASSERT `what the Company pays under` `the CGL part` `, for` `the policy` `,` `the ordinary products claim` `,` `the ordinary sums` `,` `the hypothetical rates` `,` `nothing paid yet` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `what the Company pays under` `the P&CO part` `, for` `the policy` `,` `the ordinary products claim` `,` `the ordinary sums` `,` `the hypothetical rates` `,` (`already paid: combined` 9_500_000_000 `, bodily injury` 0 `, property damage` 0) EQUALS 500_000_000
