#ASSERT `Condition 1 — the adjustment of an earned premium of` 120_000_000 `against premium paid of` 100_000_000 EQUALS `the named insured pays the earned premium due` 20_000_000
#ASSERT `Condition 1 — the adjustment of an earned premium of` 100_000_000 `against premium paid of` 100_000_000 EQUALS `no adjustment`
