§§ `A10 — Condition 3, the insured's duties (src:207-227)`

GIVEN witnesses IS A BOOLEAN, writing IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A written notice of an occurrence`
`a notice with witnesses named` witnesses `, in writing` writing MEANS
    `A written notice of an occurrence` WITH
        `in writing`                                                                       IS writing
        `contains particulars sufficient to identify the insured`                         IS TRUE
        `contains reasonably obtainable information on the time, place and circumstances` IS TRUE
        `contains the names and addresses of the injured`                                 IS TRUE
        `contains the names and addresses of available witnesses`                         IS witnesses
        `given by or for the insured to the Company or one of its authorized agents`      IS TRUE
#ASSERT `Condition 3(a) — the notice has the content and route required` (`a notice with witnesses named` TRUE `, in writing` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `Condition 3(a) — the notice has the content and route required` (`a notice with witnesses named` FALSE `, in writing` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `Condition 3(a) — the notice has the content and route required` (`a notice with witnesses named` TRUE `, in writing` FALSE)

-- The duties, traced in days. No period is stated, so the notice duty stands until done.
#TRACE `Condition 3(a) — notice of an occurrence` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the insured` DOES `give written notice of the occurrence to the Company or an authorized agent` AT 3
#TRACE `Condition 3(a) — notice of an occurrence` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 400)
#TRACE `Condition 3(c) — no voluntary payment, obligation or expense` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the insured` DOES `voluntarily make a payment, assume an obligation or incur an expense other than for first aid` AT 5
#TRACE `Condition 6 — the insured secures the rights of recovery` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the insured` DOES `execute and deliver instruments and papers to secure the rights of recovery` AT 10

§§ `A11 — Condition 4, Action Against Company (src:229-241)`

#ASSERT `Condition 4 — an action lies against the Company` (`a bodily injury claim where` (LIST `it is the case that` `there has been full compliance with all of the terms of the Policy`, `it is the case that` `the insured's obligation to pay has been finally determined by judgement against the insured after actual trial`))
#ASSERT `Condition 4 — an action lies against the Company` (`a bodily injury claim where` (LIST `it is the case that` `there has been full compliance with all of the terms of the Policy`, `it is the case that` `the insured's obligation to pay has been finally determined by written agreement of the insured, the claimant and the Company`))
#ASSERT NOT `Condition 4 — an action lies against the Company` (`a bodily injury claim where` (`only` `there has been full compliance with all of the terms of the Policy`))
#ASSERT NOT `Condition 4 — an action lies against the Company` (`a bodily injury claim where` (`only` `the insured's obligation to pay has been finally determined by judgement against the insured after actual trial`))
#ASSERT `Condition 4 — the claimant is entitled to recover under the Policy` (`a bodily injury claim where` (LIST `it is the case that` `there has been full compliance with all of the terms of the Policy`, `it is the case that` `the insured's obligation to pay has been finally determined by judgement against the insured after actual trial`))

§§ `A12 — Condition 5, Other Insurance (src:243-264)`

-- (a) equal shares. Loss 300, limits 500 and 500: 150 each.
#ASSERT `Condition 5(a) — the Company's share of` 300 `by equal shares, our limit` 500 `, other limits` (LIST 500) EQUALS 150
-- Loss 600, limits 100, 200 (ours), 500: equal shares of 200 would exceed the lowest
-- limit, so the 100 insurer pays 100; 500 left between two, 250 each would exceed 200, so
-- ours pays 200; the last pays 300. Ours: 200.
#ASSERT `Condition 5(a) — the Company's share of` 600 `by equal shares, our limit` 200 `, other limits` (LIST 100, 500) EQUALS 200
-- Loss 300, limits 100 (ours) and 1,000: ours pays its 100 and the other 200.
#ASSERT `Condition 5(a) — the Company's share of` 300 `by equal shares, our limit` 100 `, other limits` (LIST 1000) EQUALS 100
-- Loss above all limits together: each pays its limit.
#ASSERT `Condition 5(a) — the Company's share of` 2000 `by equal shares, our limit` 100 `, other limits` (LIST 500) EQUALS 100
-- (b) by limits. 300 x 100 / (100 + 200) = 100; 400 x 100 / 400 = 100; 90 x 100 / 300 = 30.
#ASSERT `Condition 5(b) — the Company's share of` 300 `by limits, our limit` 100 `, other limits` (LIST 200) EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `Condition 5(b) — the Company's share of` 400 `by limits, our limit` 100 `, other limits` (LIST 100, 200) EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `Condition 5(b) — the Company's share of` 90 `by limits, our limit` 100 `, other limits` (LIST 200) EQUALS 30

GIVEN basis IS A `A basis of insurance`, limit IS A NUMBER, equal IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Another insurance`
`another insurance on a` basis `basis with limit` limit `, equal shares:` equal MEANS
    `Another insurance` WITH
        `applies to the loss on the basis of`       IS basis
        `the applicable limit of liability`         IS limit
        `provides for contribution by equal shares` IS equal

-- Primary, the other excess: not reduced. Same basis, all equal shares: (a). Same basis,
-- one not: (b), 400 x 100 / (100 + 500 + 200) = 50. Excess against a primary: declined.
#ASSERT `Condition 5 — the most of the loss the Company is liable for, of` 300 `with our limit` 500 `, on the basis` `primary` `, alongside` (LIST `another insurance on a` `excess` `basis with limit` 1000 `, equal shares:` TRUE) EQUALS 300
#ASSERT `Condition 5 — the most of the loss the Company is liable for, of` 300 `with our limit` 500 `, on the basis` `primary` `, alongside` (LIST `another insurance on a` `primary` `basis with limit` 500 `, equal shares:` TRUE) EQUALS 150
#ASSERT `Condition 5 — the most of the loss the Company is liable for, of` 400 `with our limit` 100 `, on the basis` `primary` `, alongside` (LIST `another insurance on a` `primary` `basis with limit` 500 `, equal shares:` TRUE, `another insurance on a` `primary` `basis with limit` 200 `, equal shares:` FALSE) EQUALS 50
#ASSERT `Condition 5 — the most of the loss the Company is liable for, of` 300 `with our limit` 500 `, on the basis` `excess` `, alongside` EMPTY EQUALS 300
#ASSERT REFUSED `Condition 5 — the most of the loss the Company is liable for, of` 300 `with our limit` 500 `, on the basis` `excess` `, alongside` (LIST `another insurance on a` `primary` `basis with limit` 500 `, equal shares:` TRUE) BECAUSE "Condition 5 does not say how an excess or contingent insurance shares with insurance on another basis"

