#ASSERT NOT `Condition 9 — the Company's notice, mailed on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, validly states the effective date` (YMD 2026 3 10)
-- Pro rata on the Company's cancellation: 365,000,000 for 1 January 2026 to 1 January
-- 2027 (365 days), cancelled on 1 April 2026 (90 days): 90,000,000 earned.
#ASSERT `Condition 9 — the earned premium when` `the Company` `cancels, on a premium of` 365_000_000 `for a period from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `to` (YMD 2027 1 1) `, cancelled on` (YMD 2026 4 1) EQUALS 90_000_000
#ASSERT REFUSED `Condition 9 — the earned premium when` `the named insured` `cancels, on a premium of` 365_000_000 `for a period from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `to` (YMD 2027 1 1) `, cancelled on` (YMD 2026 4 1) BECAUSE "Condition 9: the customary short rate table and procedure are not in the document"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Condition 9 — the earned premium when` `the insured` `cancels, on a premium of` 365_000_000 `for a period from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `to` (YMD 2027 1 1) `, cancelled on` (YMD 2026 4 1) BECAUSE "Condition 9 gives the right to cancel only to the named insured and the Company"
#TRACE `Condition 9 — the Company returns the unearned premium` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Company` DOES `return the unearned portion of the premium` AT 20

§§ `A15 — Sistership paragraph 1 (src:904-908) and Condition 1 records (src:192-194)`

#TRACE `Sistership 1 — the named insured withdraws, repairs or replaces, or takes all reasonable steps` AT 0 WITH
